send:P9 *  *  *  * +OU *  *  *  *
send:P+
send:P-
send:-
send:END Position
send:END Game_Summary
recv:AGREE test+test-30-5F+Enemy+usi-csa-bridge+20260805000700
send:START:test+test-30-5F+Enemy+usi-csa-bridge+20260805000700
recv:-4252HI
